# Token-ops inventory — authoritative list of every ERC20 token-moving call
# site in production `src/`. Every new `transfer` / `transferFrom` /
# `safeTransfer` / `safeTransferFrom` call merged into `src/` must be added
# here (file:line) with the spec rule that upholds its invariant, or the
# lint-token-ops.sh gate will refuse the merge.
#
# Format: `<path>:<line> | <caller> | <spec coverage>`
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Spec coverage column lists the CVL rule(s) in certora/TokenOpsVerification.spec
# (or a sister spec) that prove the call's invariant. Pending entries are
# marked `[PENDING: <spec target>]` — new entries MAY ship pending, but must
# be followed by a spec PR within the same sprint.

src/FigaroCore.sol:131 | _pullExact (commit bond pull) | commitBuyerExactDelta, commitSellerExactDelta, commitContractExactDelta, commitAllowanceDrainSafety, commitTokenConservation
src/FigaroCore.sol:289 | resolveProcess (seller payout) | resolveSingleOrderPayout, resolveSingleOrderConservation
src/FigaroCore.sol:290 | resolveProcess (buyer payout)  | resolveSingleOrderPayout, resolveSingleOrderConservation
src/FigaroBatchVerifier.sol:374 | settleBatch → _executePositions (net payout to user)    | singlePositionUserDelta, singlePositionContractDelta, singlePositionAllowanceDrainSafety, singlePositionConservation
src/FigaroBatchVerifier.sol:384 | settleBatch → _pullExact (net deposit from user)        | singlePositionUserDelta, singlePositionContractDelta, singlePositionAllowanceDrainSafety, singlePositionConservation
